* Make Page Number Into Ptr & Mask
*
* Input: D = Page Number
*        X = Map Beginning Address
* Output: A = Bit Mask
*         B = 0
*         X = Byte Address
* Local: None
* Global: None
*
FNDBIT pshs B Save lsb
 lsra PAGE/2
 rorb
 lsra PAGE/4
 rorb
 lsra PAGE/8
 rorb
 leax D,X Get byte address
 puls B Get lsb
 lda #$80 Get mask
 andb #7 Page modulo 8
 beq FNDB20 Branch if done
FNDB10 lsra SHIFT Mask
 decb
 bne FNDB10
FNDB20 rts
 page
